      "url": "https://x.com/QCGov/status/2056601388852170950",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QCGov/status/2056601388852170950",
      "text": "Happy Lechon Festival, QC! 🐷\n\nMuling nagbabalik ang pinakamasarap at putok-batok na kapistahan sa Quezon City! Tampok dito ang iba’t ibang aktibidad, kabilang ang parada ng naggagandahang floats sa Lechon Parade.\n\nMakakaasa kayong paiigtingin pa ng lokal na pamahalaan ang mga programang tutugon at magpapaunlad sa Lungsod Quezon.\n\nPanoorin ang weekly recap na ito para sa linggo ng May 11, 2026. Makikita ang iba pang detalye sa:\n\n•  La Loma Lechon Festival:\nhttps://t.co/1FkazvJNTS\n\nhttps://t.co/PLRGgPHOEG\n\nhttps://t.co/wSus6LoCsz\n\nhttps://t.co/od4h6AprbV\n\n• Riverview Inspection:\nhttps://t.co/6c7eLFuJJv\n\n•  Gawad Lingkod Bayani Regional Qualifiers:\nhttps://t.co/D1vGHQMUMI\n\n• Pugay Tagumpay 2026:\nhttps://t.co/mw0xO2DlSZ\n\n• Financial Assistance to Fire Victims from Pasong Putik, Batasan Hills, and Bagong Pag-Asa:\nhttps://t.co/kYsGGrJANm\n\n• Vegetable Delivery:\nhttps://t.co/I3UmE8UBqD\n\n• 119th Annual Convention of the Philippine Medical Association:\nhttps://t.co/GiGyYCV2Pl\n\n• Meeting with Philippine Guarantee:\nhttps://t.co/menfi8Qaub\n \n• Ombudsman Benchmarking:\nhttps://t.co/DX1npKeNds\n\n• Memorandum of Agreement Signing with RunRio and Pride PH:\nhttps://t.co/d5rBWerYmb\n\n#BusyQCWeeklyRecap",
